Circulars and Notices\nAnnouncements\nNewsletters\nNews, Recent events & Achievements\nJob openings\n📋 Admission Merit List\nCOURSES OFFERED POST GRADUATE\nMaster of Arts in Education under Gauhati University\nThe MA Education program at Kaliabor College under Gauhati University is designed to provide students with a\r\ncomprehensive understanding of educational theories, practices, policies and research. The program focuses on\r\nequipping students with the knowledge and skills necessary for critical analysis, evaluation, and improvement of\r\neducational systems.\nSeat \r\n                    capacity\nFees\n25\nRs. \r\n                  16000 per\nSemester\nContact Person:\nDr. Pradip Mochahary,Coordinator Phone: 8134954649\nMaster of Commerce under Gauhati University\nThe M.Com. program at Kaliabor College under Gauhati University aims to provide students with a deeper\r\nunderstanding of concepts, theories and practices in commerce and related disciplines. It equips students with the\r\nnecessary skills and knowledge to excel in areas such as accounting, finance, taxation, business management, and\r\neconomics.\nSeat \r\n                    capacity\nFees\n40\nRs. \r\n                  12000 per\nSemester\nContact Person:\nMr. Ridip Das,Coordinator Phone:\r\n9435146595\nAddress\nKaliabor College\nP.O- Kuwaritol,Sub Division- Kaliabor\nDist- Nagaon,Pin-782137\n03672-295517(O)\n03672-295519(R)\nkaliaborcollege@gmail.com\nUseful Links\nNEP@GU\nUGC\nNAAC\nMHRD\nIGNOU\nAHSEC\nFees Refund Policy\nImportant Links\nGauhati University\nDibrugarh university\nTezpur University\nDHE Assam\nMSS Vishwavidyalaya\nACTA\nOur Location\nCopyright ©\n,Kaliabor College\nTerms and Conditions\nPowered by\nS.S. Technologies", "links": [{"label": "Download", "url": "https://kaliaborcollege.ac.in/download.php"}, {"label": "Voter Slip 2026", "url": "https://kaliaborcollege.ac.in/VoterSlip2026/"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://kaliaborcollege.ac.in/index.php"}, {"label": "Staff Login", "u